# What `railway up` must not upload from this directory.
#
# The Docker build installs dependencies and compiles TypeScript itself, so the
# local node_modules and dist are pure upload weight. The .env entries matter
# more: this directory is not tracked by git, so nothing else would stop a local
# development .env — Supabase service role included — from being shipped to the
# build service.
node_modules
dist

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.log
.DS_Store
